ical rehearsal provenance, strict gates and failure propagation.\n- Execute credential-free host, native workerd and real byte validation paths\n  in the existing firmware workflow, including negative cases.\n- Preserve nightly/PR isolation. No P3-5/P4-3/P4-4 task or device operation.\n\n## Existing Actual Evidence\n\nTested product: `fa74905e84c489cccc248617d37ab9f56c8f961c`.\nInitial reviewed-record candidate: `55eac1d49851b9024d6b7fcfb078e5fbae8fc5a9`.\nEvidence commit: `4c149e7810f816316dc038398f70642565a9391e`.\n\n- Firmware run https://github.com/Eitan-S-23/E-Track/actions/runs/38642386248 passed:\n  host script/migration 34, pipeline host 20, native workerd 156, package 8,\n  historical golden vectors 9, workflow 15, byte preparation 19; GCC App/Boot\n  and development-only full/recovery packaging also ran.\n- Backend run https://github.com/Eitan-S-23/E-Track/actions/runs/38641540543 passed\n  on unchanged backend inputs. Its repeated native tests are not extra unique tests.\n- GCC retains 640 compiler/linker warnings; vendor bsdiff has 6 warnings.\n  Failed prior runs and raw diagnostics are preserved, not rewritten.\n- Originals and complete byte identities: `docs/ota-exec-notes/P4-1-ci-2026-10-15/`.\n- Scope, affected consumers, configuration handoff, audit and remaining owners:\n  `docs/ota-exec-notes/P4-1-implementation-2026-10-15.md`.\n\n## Remaining Gates\n\nIndependent bounded development review is in progress. It cannot waive the\nwhole-card real-observation requirements. The read-only GitHub inventory currently\nfinds no Release or release environment in this repository. The prior Cloudflare\n401/expired login was not retried. An authoritative formal finalized base,\nisolated Worker/D1/R2 bindings, real full-byte upload readback, register-ready\nidempotency and production-zero-effect snapshots remain NOT_RUN.\n\nDo not dispatch the out-of-scope legacy `mcu-firmware-release.yml`, use test assets\nas an official base, create a Release, or unlock `OTA_BOOT_CHAIN_READY` through\nthis PR. Rehearsal/production and independent acceptance still follow the sole\nP4-1 Spec and frozen contracts.\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T22:50:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:23:59Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"76e8c8a924fe4dba642c9972fa6f9d698ff00436","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eitan-S-23/E-Track/pulls/27/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eitan-S-23/E-Track/pulls/27/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eitan-S-23/E-Track/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eitan-S-23/E-Track/issues/27/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eitan-S-23/E-Track/statuses/c860b3be7a0b1a3ca1b3a53cf79cc9ef21cc9124","head":{"label":"Eitan-S-23:dev/p4-1/unattended-20261015","ref":"dev/p4-1/unattended-20261015","sha":"c860b3be7a0b1a3ca1b3a53cf79cc9ef21cc9124","user":{"login":"Eitan-S-23","id":204050265,"node_id":"U_kgDODCmPWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204050265?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23","html_url":"https://github.com/Eitan-S-23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eitan-S-23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":131064